OL,3,GNEWSALying down in historic hall 'like
OL,4,Astargazing'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA tourist attraction is encouraging
OL,7,Fvisitors to take a different
OL,8,Fperspective by lying down on its
OL,9,F210-year-old floor.
OL,11,FBelsay Hall has temporarily installed a
OL,12,Fstack of cushions so visitors can "lie
OL,13,Fdown and look up" at a ceiling
OL,14,Fconsidered one of the finest in
OL,15,FEngland, according to English Heritage.
OL,17,FThe pillar hall in the Greek-inspired
OL,18,Fbuilding, which was built between 1811
OL,19,Fand 1817, mimics a Mediterranean
OL,20,Fcourtyard but has a glass roof to keep
OL,21,Fout the worst of the Northumberland
OL,22,Fweather.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,397,390,260,160,0,100
