OL,3,GNEWSALying down in historic hall 'like
OL,4,Astargazing'
OL,5,
OL,6,FVisitor David Turner says: "It was a
OL,7,Fbit of a struggle for me, but once I
OL,8,Fgot down it was just like stargazing."
